            <div xml:id="d572">

                <pb facs="0509" n="393" sameAs="frus:frus1912/pg393"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 822.00/193.]</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The American Minister to the Secretary of
                    State</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegrams.—Paraphrases.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Quito</hi></placeName>, (<date
                            ana="#date_undated-inferred-from-document-content-and-sibling-dates"
                            calendar="gregorian" notAfter="1912-01-12T23:59:59-05:00"
                            notBefore="1912-01-06T00:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >undated</hi></date>)<hi rendition="#italic">; received January 12,
                            1912</hi>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The January 6 instruction from the Department was complied with immediately.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Young.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
